    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a non-changing dynamic component in the ecosystem model. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements a dynamics model where the associated value does not change with time. All operations simply return the base value or perform no action on update. It inherits from <ref refid="class_non_mass_based_dynamics" kindref="compound">NonMassBasedDynamics</ref> and implements its virtual interface with constant behavior.</para>
<para>Typical use cases:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Traits or parameters that are constant for an individual</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Fixed environmental or physiological factors</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Default or placeholder dynamics when no temporal evolution is required </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
